LitePack: third-party notices
=============================

This file lists the third-party software in LitePack's shipped programs (lpk, from the crates lpk-cli,
lpk-core, lpk-format, lpk-codecs-bwt and lpk-codecs-vp8; lpk-check; lpk-worker-libarchive; lpk-worker, with
lpk-foreign; lpk-gui; lpk_shell.dll; and the installer) and reproduces the notices and licence texts their
licences require. It is generated by scripts/third-party-notices.sh with cargo-about (about.toml,
about-gui.toml and the about-*.hbs templates) and the texts in notices/; do not edit it by hand.

================================================================================
Third-party code inside LitePack's own crates
================================================================================

